{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_ex01_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_ex01","title":"预热活动","storyCode":"OF-EX1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"8cffd20a1efeedd8313e2556f4324c25ab131bd9c3b1807a211977e4b29a6d24","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"֪知名DJ D.D.D.在旅馆中与TA的经纪人聊天，他对音乐高涨的热情令人动容。而聊到最后，TA居然收到了来自可露希尔的短讯——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）\n叮铃铃，叮铃铃，叮铃铃......\n咚砰叭砰咚砰叭砰擦擦擦擦擦\n欸欸欸欸欸~♪（人声vocal）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还不起床！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎......哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昨，昨晚high太晚了啦！让我再多睡会儿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，冷水澡还是很棒！我有预感，今天会是很棒的一天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先把青草汁喝了，已经让侍应生放在你的酒店冰箱里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那个也太难喝了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可是知道的，你在昨天黑曜石节的主持节目里大喊了两分钟对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然你不是歌手，但也要好好保养嗓子啊？不过昨天的演出很成功，祝贺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"我试过了，不论怎么努力，我还是有那种感觉，我就是没法超过D.litHun."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你已经做得很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？嗯......无所谓啦。我决定了，之前那张合作专辑，要比上次再多做四首remix的demo，这样合作方也有挑选的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再加量？！你这几天已经混了二十六首了，哪怕你把它当作没出席活动时的练习，也不可以这样透支体力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，昨天晚上，就在演出里，我摸到了个新点子，这几个方向我都想试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经差不多知道自己的极限在哪里了。既然我知道它在那里，我就得不断冲击它，让它变得更高，让我更难摸到它，这才是进步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可演出怎么办？你的日程表可是一直排到下一年啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对没问题！演出的精力是放在另一个槽里的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已经听不懂你在说什么了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这么长时间以来，我有什么出差错的地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上次你可是把整个录音棚里的灯全爆了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那是法术的问题，不是音乐吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你也提醒到我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"如果理论是正确的，那我在构思和乐感上......绝对能达到更高的高度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......源石技艺和音乐的关系只是种假说，你可不要被牵着鼻子走哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我有鼻子的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是该现在由你来问我的事情吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但莱塔尼亚人做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"音符、调子、曲式、织体，都和源石技艺的编织一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊！太沉重了！感觉这也不是那么适合我的思考！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能知道这一点，我已经很欣慰了，呜呜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能要去放松一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"挺好的，别憋太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，可也别再把一整个城区弄停电了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不会的！我会有分寸的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"对了对了，上次你说的那个什么克洛宁，我也见过一面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感觉怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"实话说......作为合作伙伴，应该不怎么样吧。他大概是只看钱的那种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我上次看合同的时候也有这样的感觉......无所谓，赞助商这边也是塞壬说了算。我还是信得过你看人的眼光的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在外面也小心点，据说汐斯塔不简单。Grace那个号也暂时别再用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"安心啦，说了我是有分寸的，这可是堡垒中的堡垒，秘密中的秘密！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"经纪人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的秘密小组织，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"音乐人总要有自己的空间！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？有简讯......还好，不愧是旅游城市，城际网路还是很快的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这个频道？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"“From Ada.Closure.Church”......咦，居然是可露希尔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“听说这次音乐节非常成功，祝贺你:P”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_title1"},{"type":"narration","text":"“很久没见了，Grace. 你还联系得到Dijkstra吗？找机会再叫他一起去做点大事吧！”\n“对了，注意身体:3”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然今天也会是很棒的一天！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
